[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひとまず、この島で分かったのはこれくらいです。\n果ての大陸のことも何か分かれば良かったんですけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's about all I could find out about this island. I was hoping to learn something about World's End too..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "結局……アルビーナから聞いた「門」の伝承以外の\nことは、何も情報を得られませんでした",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In the end... I couldn't find any information beyond the legend of the gate that Alvina told us about."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "となると、また別の島に行ってみるしかなさそうだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Looks like we'll have to visit another island then."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい、そのつもりです。ただ、その前に\nアルビーナたちともう一度話をしないと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's the plan. But before that, I need to speak with Alvina and the others again."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "彼女たちがこの旅に同行するかどうか……ですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To see if they'll join us on this journey... correct?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ですので、数日後に集まって\n色々と話し合おうということになっています",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, we're planning to meet and discuss everything in a few days."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その間は何をする予定なの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What will you do in the meantime?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろん、できる限りこの島で調査を続けます！\n今のうちにやれることは、全部やっておきたいので！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Continue investigating this island as much as possible, of course! I want to do everything I can while we're still here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それなら、この天才が手を貸してあげようか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In that case, perhaps a certain genius could lend you a hand?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ、久しぶり",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Long time no see, Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヨハナちゃん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わあ～！\u3000久しぶり！\u3000元気だった！？\nちゃんとご飯食べてた！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow! It's been so long! How have you been? Have you been eating properly?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと近い……！\u3000見ての通り元気よ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're a bit too close...! I'm fine, as you can see!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あと、ついでにおまけもいるから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, and there's a bonus tag-along too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと！\u3000おまけって言わないでくれる！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey! Don't call me a 'bonus'!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あー！\u3000イルちゃん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh! It's Ilmeria!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わ、ソフィーさん！\u3000プラフタさんも！\n二人ともこっちに来てたんですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, Sophie! And Plachta too! I didn't know you two were here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もしや、この方も錬金術士……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Could it be that you're an alchemist as well...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よくぞ聞いてくれたわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm glad you asked!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシの名前はイルメリア・フォン・ラインウェバー。\n超一流の天才錬金術士よ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My name is Ilmeria Von Leinweber. I'm a first-class genius alchemist!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イルちゃんはフィリスちゃんのお友達で\nとっても優秀な錬金術士なんだよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria is Firis's friend and a very talented alchemist!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、なんと……！\nそのような方と出会えるとは、なんという僥倖！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-wow...! What an honor to meet you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "心強い仲間がまた一人増えたってことだね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Looks like we've got another powerful ally on our side!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふん、大船に乗ったつもりでいなさい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmph! You can rest easy now that I'm here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ところで、ヨハナちゃん。\nオリバーさんのことは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "By the way, Johanna. About Oliver..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それはもう大丈夫。私の中で一区切りついたから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's all settled now. I've made my peace with it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "一区切りって……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Made your peace...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さーて、調査よ調査。\n新天地に来たからには色々調べないと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then, let's get investigating! We've got new lands to explore!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、待ちなさいよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, wait for me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナちゃんも行こ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's go too, Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "う、うん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yeah..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "天才を自称する、レスナの友達の少女。\n高い戦闘技術を持ち、その腕に強い自信がある",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A girl who claims to be a genius and is a friend of Resna's. She possesses exceptional combat skills and has great confidence in her abilities."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "超一流の天才錬金術士を自称する少女。プライドが\n高いが努力家で、錬金術に対して真摯に取り組んでいる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A girl who calls herself a first-class genius alchemist. Though prideful, she's hardworking and takes alchemy very seriously."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア・フォン・ラインウェバー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria Von Leinweber"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]